Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.30,0:09:16.43,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We don't know where the enemy will come from!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.68,0:09:18.89,Alternative,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Listen! Use your eyes to find them!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.18,0:01:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So we're restricted to visual range? They fought this way ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.98,0:01:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.82,0:01:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we'll go greet our guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.40,0:01:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them kill you... You kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.21,0:02:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Second Attack Force, launch immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.84,0:02:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Repeat: Second Attack Force, launch immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.98,0:02:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Fomt Berger, launching.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.42,0:02:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Second Attack Force is in position.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.71,0:02:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Activating Matter Transfer System!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.26,0:02:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Inputting recon data.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.30,0:03:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Coordinates: directly over the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.39,0:03:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Preparing to fire matter transfer waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.64,0:03:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.12,0:03:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,There they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.29,0:03:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy is right above us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.81,0:03:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Direct hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.33,0:03:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Damage control!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.69,0:03:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Gunners, prepare for AA combat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.20,0:04:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Maintain a wall of fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.24,0:04:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Secondary gunport 1 hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.37,0:04:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.41,0:04:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Bridge, this is Yamamoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.46,0:04:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Alpha 2, launching.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.84,0:04:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Melhi, you get the catapult.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.18,0:04:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll knock out its eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.77,0:04:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't want it to sink yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.40,0:04:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy to the rear!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.69,0:04:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.48,0:04:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Port-side catapult has been destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.90,0:04:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Gunners, keep firing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.57,0:04:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato to fighters!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.37,0:04:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Yamato! Do you read us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.91,0:04:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We are under surprise attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.45,0:04:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All fighters are to return and defend the Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.50,0:04:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.75,0:04:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,These are decoys?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.33,0:04:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.76,0:05:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lose it, Kobashi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.55,0:05:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll shoot them all down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.06,0:05:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Daikuhara's down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.48,0:05:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Akira, try to keep them busy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.00,0:05:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,One lone fighter held us all off?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.25,0:05:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Our job is done... Withdraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.46,0:05:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They're withdrawing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.80,0:05:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Bridge Three to Bridge One.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.55,0:05:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The converter's damaged. We cannot deploy the Wave Motion Shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.85,0:05:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, it will affect our inertial control!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.31,0:05:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll head up the repairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.39,0:05:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But where did they come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.81,0:05:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Warp.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.81,0:06:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's impossible... Warping in those little fighters?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.23,0:06:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't fight if you only rely on what you think you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.86,0:06:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy commander is excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.33,0:06:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent, Berger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.12,0:06:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Surface, then release our guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.80,0:06:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Be certain you remember this face.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.59,0:06:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,She's beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.72,0:06:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,She is of noble birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.47,0:06:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't fall in love, Norran.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.31,0:06:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? N-No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.94,0:07:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Norran, stay here and secure the airlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.57,0:07:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Zar Belk.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.69,0:07:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Barlen? How does it feel, being back in that old bucket?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.87,0:07:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful... I may look old, but I'm as sharp as I was in my youth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.00,0:07:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Garlent, taking off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.14,0:08:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy commander has more in store.\NKeep an eye on the surroundings, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.27,0:08:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,With our own eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.94,0:08:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,With our ship blinded and deafened,\Nvictory depends on our own human ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.53,0:08:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There should be a current of ion turbulence nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.70,0:08:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Use the data we've gathered to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.20,0:08:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.62,0:08:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy dead ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.50,0:08:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a present for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.60,0:08:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A dud?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.98,0:08:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Present delivered.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.23,0:08:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pulling out...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.69,0:08:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.88,0:09:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay! Everyone to stations!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.76,0:09:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.51,0:09:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yurisha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.59,0:09:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoshina...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.28,0:09:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.74,0:09:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Please keep back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.68,0:09:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep back...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.27,0:09:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.14,0:09:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Sending data on dud to Bridge Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.11,0:09:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Wave Motion Gun Control Room, report.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.33,0:09:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy device advancing toward the gun's chamber!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.54,0:09:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Pressure in chamber is dropping!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.29,0:09:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Close the safety valves! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.09,0:09:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.44,0:09:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.92,0:09:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.27,0:10:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Inertial control is down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.23,0:10:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So that was no dud.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.44,0:10:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It probably had a delay fuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.36,0:10:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a problem...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.65,0:10:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Sanada, on Bridge Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.61,0:10:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.86,0:10:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a suggestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.30,0:10:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You there...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.92,0:10:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I've seen you before. Where are you stationed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.05,0:10:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We are...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.72,0:10:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's fired a gun on deck 6!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.56,0:10:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a Garmillan gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.58,0:10:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Security to deck 6. Kodai, take command.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.81,0:10:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.53,0:11:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoshina!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.04,0:11:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.92,0:11:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They've seen our faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.34,0:11:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.67,0:11:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The Iscandarian!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.47,0:11:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.18,0:11:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We have her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.70,0:11:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised it got through so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.54,0:11:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't a weapon to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.04,0:11:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They turned it into a makeshift weapon. That's probably why.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.75,0:11:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1065)}A logical conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.92,0:11:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy is starting to get cornered.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.22,0:12:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So are we, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.35,0:12:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.52,0:12:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay, rookie?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.90,0:12:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sawamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.86,0:12:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't push yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.11,0:12:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy ship at ten o'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.16,0:12:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a carrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.29,0:12:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Kobashi, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.58,0:12:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.58,0:12:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Kobashi! Kobashi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.96,0:12:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.13,0:12:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy to port side!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.67,0:12:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Begin AA fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.55,0:12:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.10,0:12:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kobashi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.94,0:13:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.60,0:13:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.53,0:13:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.80,0:14:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.97,0:14:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Garmillan soldiers?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.47,0:14:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Mori!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.31,0:14:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.56,0:14:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.02,0:14:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Bridge, Garmillans are on board!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.90,0:14:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.84,0:14:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.47,0:14:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Gelt!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.70,0:14:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Norran... Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.41,0:14:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Fulfill your mission, and make Zaltz proud!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.84,0:14:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail Zaltz!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.22,0:14:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yuki!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.22,0:14:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yuki! Yuki!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.98,0:14:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.31,0:15:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to retrieve the suckerfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.04,0:15:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I do? What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.67,0:15:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yuki!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.63,0:15:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Encrypted message from the Hound.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.47,0:15:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The suckerfish has our target.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.22,0:15:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The Schderg is requesting permission to launch the attack teams.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.31,0:15:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we send them?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.50,0:15:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the boring projectile explodes, it should finish the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.48,0:15:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But there are no certainties in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.15,0:15:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Launch the torpedo bombers and ensure that we sink the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.11,0:15:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Attack Force, launch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.60,0:16:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Niimi to bridge. The detonator has been disabled.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.39,0:16:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.73,0:16:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.69,0:16:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.51,0:16:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Die, Garmillans!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.28,0:17:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I won't let you get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.91,0:17:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Attack Force here! Requesting reinforcements!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.33,0:17:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We have encountered and engaged the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.46,0:17:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.22,0:17:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.97,0:17:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So the heavens tell me to sink the Yamato myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.93,0:17:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I shall do their bidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.73,0:17:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Fleet, advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.45,0:17:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We're mooring you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.62,0:18:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighters have returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.45,0:18:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Twelve didn't make it back...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.08,0:18:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Resupply as fast as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.12,0:18:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ota, did you find that ion turbulence?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.71,0:18:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.88,0:18:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Recon Team to bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.67,0:18:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy ships to starboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.14,0:18:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So they're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.44,0:18:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Analyzer!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.65,0:18:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.00,0:18:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Evasive maneuvers!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.34,0:18:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn forty degrees to port! Combat speed 1!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.01,0:19:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But the ion storm is right there! If it sucks us in, we'll be adrift!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.99,0:19:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you not hear my order?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.60,0:19:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.85,0:19:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Changing course. Forty degrees to port.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.98,0:19:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ota, transmit the enemy device's course to the gunnery officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.15,0:19:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nanbu, when its axis is aligned with the enemy fleet, shoot it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.65,0:19:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.90,0:19:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't miss, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.53,0:19:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me. Guns are my specialty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.00,0:19:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Evasive maneuvers!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.91,0:19:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Schderg is down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.22,0:19:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Remain calm!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.22,0:19:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy ship is firing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.47,0:19:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! I'll load missiles and launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.23,0:19:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.33,0:19:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I want revenge...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.15,0:19:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to let it end this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.87,0:20:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Berger!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.83,0:20:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire all cannons!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.59,0:20:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.51,0:20:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep calm! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.43,0:20:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Concentrate all remaining firepower on that ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.94,0:20:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep firing at them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.69,0:20:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.99,0:20:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Right the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.66,0:20:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't! The ion turbulence has us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.66,0:20:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Was this their plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.13,0:21:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The ion turbulence has caught the enemy ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.51,0:21:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they lure me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.39,0:21:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My arrogance led me to try to sink them personally...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.98,0:21:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,At the very end, I made the wrong move.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.61,0:21:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Engine output is dropping!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.00,0:21:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn to port!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.94,0:21:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The helm's not responding! We can't maintain the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.99,0:21:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Elk Domel, ID #17492-ZEKU.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.32,0:21:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.99,0:21:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is now my personal fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.00,0:21:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All crew, abandon ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.67,0:21:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're all headed to the\Ncourt martial for disobeying orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.73,0:22:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire anchor!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.49,0:22:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This looks bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.04,0:22:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.45,0:22:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy has attached itself to the bottom of the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.00,0:22:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy ship is hailing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.33,0:22:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Video message.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.04,0:22:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Display it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.22,0:22:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish to speak to your commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.60,0:22:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I am this ship's captain, Juzo Okita.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.39,0:22:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Garmillas Military Galactic Theater Commander Elk Domel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.81,0:22:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,At last, we meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.94,0:22:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I share your sentiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.40,0:22:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Okita, allow me to express my\Nadmiration for your splendid command.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.95,0:22:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Domel, the battle is over.\NI do not wish to fight if it isn't necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.25,0:23:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you let us pass?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.75,0:23:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.92,0:23:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are a soldier, you should understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.93,0:23:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If I allow the Yamato to pass, my men will have died in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.47,0:23:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Okita, as a soldier... No, as a man,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.52,0:23:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I am proud to have met a man like you before my death.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.71,0:23:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Blessings and honor to you Terrons and to those of us from Garmillas!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.07,0:23:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy is going to self-destruct!\NAll crew on the lower decks, evacuate!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.01,0:23:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Elk...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.32,0:24:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.12,0:24:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.08,0:24:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wave Motion Shield came on line in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.91,0:24:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.79,0:24:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Divert power to the engines. We're leaving this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.60,0:24:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.11,0:24:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.98,0:24:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.19,0:24:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.45,0:24:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Yurisha Iscandar.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.06,0:26:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,A requiem sounds in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.15,0:26:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The Yamato barely survives its battle with Domel,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.32,0:27:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and heads to a new planet to recover from its wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.82,0:27:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It is Leptapoda, a desert planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.20,0:27:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And it holds another side as well...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.83,0:27:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: Prison Planet 17.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.71,0:27:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There are 230 days left before humanity is extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.67,0:01:34.69,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<This is Recon Ship 13.>
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.69,0:01:36.15,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Yamato sighted.>
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.15,0:01:37.11,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Repeat...>
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.45,0:02:04.79,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Enemies overhead!>
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.50,0:02:06.75,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Incoming!>
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.30,0:02:20.30,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Permission to launch.>
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.44,0:11:56.57,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Initiating connection.>
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.10,0:13:35.16,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<You are skilled.>
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.16,0:13:36.27,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<However...>
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.77,0:13:37.77,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<This is the end.>
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.90,0:13:38.83,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Rear Brigadier Ghetto!>
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.83,0:13:40.23,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<The Balgrey has been sunk! >
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.29,0:13:41.02,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<What?!>
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.69,0:13:45.57,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Damn!>
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.28,0:13:51.99,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}{\i1}<Ghale Domel!>{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.27,0:18:34.11,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Reverse.>
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.23,0:18:34.86,Gamila,,0,0,0,,{\blur7.5\shad0\bord2\pos(960,942)}<Connected.>
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.10,0:25:07.24,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1234,840)\shad0\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\fad(1500,2000)}Episode 20
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.10,0:25:07.24,EP TS,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1234,1073)\shad0\blur7.5\3aH&90&\4aH&99&\fad(1500,2000)}Under a Rainbow Sun
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.73,0:11:30.73,tsing 4,,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fax-0.1\pos(593.142,351.002)}Anabiosis Performed Successfully
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.49,0:25:22.29,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Among the distant stars
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.29,0:25:26.38,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Can you hear the wandering souls?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.38,0:25:40.35,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}In this galaxy, they can forever rest in peace
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.35,0:25:44.02,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Requiem of separation
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.02,0:25:47.53,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}With this requiem
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.53,0:25:50.15,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}Sing Along!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.20,0:25:54.78,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Voices sing to praise
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.78,0:25:58.41,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}An unforgettable memory
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.41,0:26:03.37,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}And we’ll never forget your name
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.96,0:26:10.67,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Farewell friend,\Nmy sorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.67,0:26:13.09,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Will not run out
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.09,0:26:18.18,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)}Someday in this sea of stars
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.18,0:26:20.31,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Surely
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.31,0:26:21.98,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Pray for the Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.98,0:26:23.98,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The oath
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.98,0:26:25.65,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Pray for the dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.65,0:26:27.61,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The ideal
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.86,0:26:36.91,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1000)}Last forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.54,0:00:22.50,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Farewell, Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:26.13,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The ship that is departing is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.13,0:00:30.30,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:35.39,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,2000)\blur7\be2}Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.77,0:00:39.52,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\pos(777,60)\be2}It departs now to Iscandar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.52,0:00:44.36,OP,,900,0,0,,{\an9\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}at the end of the cosmos,\Nbearing its fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:51.91,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}"We will come back, no matter what it takes"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.91,0:01:00.71,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Answer with a smile to the waving people
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:05.21,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}Going far from the Galaxy towards Iscandar
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.21,0:01:08.63,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur7\be2}A faint gleam of hope
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.63,0:01:16.18,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,3000)\blur7\be2}The Space Battleship Yamato
